# HAT TRICK: the fixes from the fidelity review, each played out.
# 1. Every boss starts at full strength: the ball waits on its own spot, so
#    nothing hits a boss before a kid has kicked it (no free opening hit).
# 2. The balloons carry each kid over to their own side before lifting them
#    away: a kid who ends a screen on their own side is soon gone, one who
#    ends it across the screen takes much longer.
# 3. The jump: a tap hops, a hold goes high, the pad steers in the air.
# 4. The ball stays lit while it bounces or rolls; only at rest does it fade.
game hattrick
wait 5
cheat run 0 0
# 1. the bosses, left alone after the intro
cheat level 10
expect hp_12 == 12
wait 220
expect sub == 1
expect hp_12 == 12
expect ball_x == 160
expect ball_rests == 1
cheat level 20
wait 220
expect hp_13 == 15
expect ball_rests == 1
cheat level 30
wait 220
expect hp_14 == 40
expect hp_15 == 10
expect ball_rests == 1
cheat level 40
wait 220
expect hp_16 == 20
expect ball_rests == 1
# 2. Teddy ends 1-1 on his own side (the left): away in well under two seconds
cheat level 1
cheat skipintro
cheat god
cheat nofoes
waituntil sub == 3 400
expect p0_x == 28
waituntil level == 2 100
# ...and ends 1-2 across the screen, on the right: carried back over first
cheat skipintro
cheat god
cheat nofoes
cheat pos 0 290 160
waituntil sub == 3 400
wait 100
expect level == 2
expect p0_x < 200
expect p0_x > 28
waituntil level == 3 300
# Mae's own side is the right
cheat run 0 1
cheat level 1
cheat skipintro
cheat god
cheat nofoes
waituntil sub == 3 400
expect p0_start_x == 292
waituntil level == 2 100
# 3. the jump and the air
cheat level 1
cheat skipintro
cheat still
cheat god
cheat pos 0 100 160
wait 3
hold A 1
waituntil p0_vy100 >= 0 60
expect p0_y > 140
waituntil p0_ground == 1 60
hold A
wait 2
waituntil p0_vy100 >= 0 60
expect p0_y < 125
release
waituntil p0_ground == 1 60
cheat pos 0 60 160
wait 3
hold RIGHT 30
hold RIGHT A 1
hold LEFT A 24
expect p0_vx100 < 0
release
waituntil p0_ground == 1 60
# 4. dropped from high, the ball bounces lit; it fades only lying still
cheat pos 0 300 160
cheat ball 100 30 0 0
cheat light
waituntil ball_bounces == 3 300
expect lit == 1
expect ball_ground == 0
waituntil lit == 0 300
expect ball_ground == 1
expect ball_rest >= 60
